msgid "The role is given once a payment completes (donor, customer). The \"Lead\" role drops off by itself when the contact gets another role."
msgstr "付款完成后即授予角色(捐赠者、客户)。当联系人获得另一个角色时,“领导”角色会自行消失。"

msgid "The contact's relationship with you. A contact can have several roles, e.g. donor and volunteer."
msgstr "联系人与您的关系。一个联系人可以有多个角色,例如捐助者和志愿者。"

