msgid "Churn risk threshold (%)"
msgstr "流失风险阈值 (%)"

msgid "Contacts above this value go to the \"Reach out\" list. Risk follows each person's own rhythm: a monthly donor is at risk after 45 days, a yearly one is not."
msgstr "高于此值的联系人将进入“联系”列表。风险遵循每个人自己的节奏:每月捐献者在 45 天后就会面临风险,而每年捐献者则不会。"

msgid "Active window (days)"
msgstr "活动窗口(天)"

msgid "A contact with any activity within this many days counts as active."
msgstr "在这么多天内进行的任何活动的联系都算作活动。"

