msgid "Everything in the CRM (contacts, fields, roles, tags, consents, timeline, segments, settings) can be read and edited from the Flux AI chat and over MCP (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor…). Tools run with the user's own CRM permissions."
msgstr "CRM 中的所有内容(联系人、字段、角色、标签、同意、时间线、细分、设置)都可以通过 Flux AI 聊天和 MCP(Claude、ChatGPT、Cursor...)读取和编辑。工具以用户自己的 CRM 权限运行。"

